      <marc:subfield code="a">This collection of poems by Sukirtharani, written between 1996 and 2016, resonates with the scent of womanhood and the strength of words. These poems naturally rise in protest against oppression, capturing not only the sorrow and anger of existence but also sounding a call to action for change. This book brings together the full range of Sukirtharani&apos;s powerful and evocative poetry over two decades.</marc:subfield>
